# Weight profile flint-bf16: Recursive's Flint as Recursive published it, the BF16 checkpoint (RecursiveSI/flint at
# revision 2a247be0, ~80 GB), the engine's quality reference. Measured on the Spark (2026-10-22, 512 greedy tokens,
# one request): plain decode 40.4-40.8 tok/s, 75.5 GiB at load. Switch with ops/use-profile.sh flint-bf16.
QSE_FLINT_VARIANT=bf16
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=RecursiveSI/flint
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=2a247be0c0aec895ccb0ac7ca92229ec6df37288
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=80.4
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the weights (75.5), the engine and its graphs, the KV, the prefill workspace and
# the 15 GiB floor
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=100
# the engine's limits. Ceiling: the weights (75.5) + the runtime (2.5) + the KV at 131,072 tokens (3.5); peak: the
# ceiling + the prefill workspace (an estimate of 4). The window stays at 131,072 so that the chat sandbox keeps
# ~25 GiB beside the engine
MEM_CEILING_GIB=82
MEM_PEAK_GIB=86
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_flint.env"
MAX_LEN=131072
